        <h3 class="text-2xl font-black text-gray-900 mb-6">Travel & Portability Ranking</h3>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-8">If you're traveling for business or a beach vacation, you need a shaver that doesn't eat up your carry-on space. Here's how our top picks rank for travel:</p>
