            <h3 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Weekly Maintenance</h3>
            <p class="text-gray-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">Exfoliate with a long-handle back scrubber 1-2 times per week to prevent ingrown hairs. Use a moisturizing body wash daily. Check for any razor bumps — small bumps that don't clear up in 5 days warrant a visit to a dermatologist.</p>
